# Ignore Python backend & heavy science dependencies on Vercel edge deployment
# Root-anchored: an unanchored 'api/' also matched viewer/api/, so the
# static line-history files (viewer/api/lines/...) were never deployed.
# api/ holds the Python backend (deployed elsewhere) and the scheduled
# dispatch function (api/schedules/). Ignore the Python files only:
# .vercelignore does not honour "!" re-includes, so "/api/*" plus
# "!/api/schedules/" drops the dispatch function too.
/api/*.py
/api/__pycache__/
/src/
/data/
/evaluation/
/tests/
/docs/
/.venv/
/requirements.txt
/Dockerfile
/railway.json
